      "last_modified": 1702940598,
      "size": "small",
      "type": "dot",
      "userid_modified": 1
     },
     "bullet_styleid": 1,
     "level": 0,
     "lineid": null,
     "text_raw": "'''Cut down vegetation in a wide area around your building site, as well.''' 20' beyond where the gravel will be should be adequate. You will need room for the brick press and rollers, and to stage other materials, too. You will also need room for people to move around and work.",
     "text_rendered": "<strong>Cut down vegetation in a wide area around your building site, as well.</strong> 20' beyond where the gravel will be should be adequate. You will need room for the brick press and rollers, and to stage other materials, too. You will also need room for people to move around and work."
    }
   ],
